# Balboa Remade - an island of the library's plan Raft Remade (in place of Raft's Balboa)
# Raft's Balboa made anew: a forest island like Balboa (the generator's "something new like" it) - hills of pine and
# maple round a mountain, beaches in the east and south. The rangers' station on a terrace above the east beach; the
# Mama bear's den in a rock outcrop on the west plateau, its mouth behind the rangers' old plank barricade, grown over
# with vines; the rangers' radio mast on the summit. Quest "The Rangers' Last Call" (20 steps, in three legs): the
# station - the flag post, its logbook, the crate it lay on, the supply crate, the machete from the tool locker, the
# ration box and the woodpile (seven pages for the journal); the den - the warning sign, the vines cut, the scrawl
# inside, the Mama bear, Hendricks' pack and the strongbox key in it; the summit - the plate on the mast, the spare
# parts box, the radio called and its desk opened; then back to the rangers' strongbox (Balboa's blueprints: the
# machete, the biofuel refiner, the fuel tank and its pipe).
#
# Built by the recipe player (CIRecipe balboa_remade) through the editor's own operations.
include lib_sea
new
# (nature like Raft's Balboa - the generator's "something new like" it - with fewer cliffs and wider beaches than its
# own: like Balboa as it is, it was a plateau ringed by cliffs with no beach to land on, 2026-10-03)
# (its trees as thick as on Raft's Balboa - 2.9 per 1000 m2; Like Raft's own pick gave half - and no boulders strewn
# over its wide beaches: the user doesn't want beaches full of stones, the review 2026-10-03)
randomize BalboaIsland like Seed=7103 Radius=110 Height=55 Hostiles=0 Cliffs=0.2 BeachWidth=0.6 Trees=0.26
clear at 0 0 r=200 only=Rock|Boulder on=sand above=0.2

# --- Terrain: the station's terrace above the east beach (5 m), the den's ground on the west plateau (its own height,
# about 9 m), the summit levelled for the mast (50 m) ------------------------------------------------------------------
brush flatten at 80 4 r=11 s=20 frames=40 h=5
# (and east of it, where the locker, the logbook's crate and the strongbox stand in front of the porch)
brush flatten at 90 3 r=8 s=20 frames=40 h=5
# (and a level spot north of the shack for the strongbox)
brush flatten at 80 12.5 r=4 s=20 frames=30 h=5
brush flatten from -80 -8.8 to -92 -8.8 r=17 s=20 frames=60
brush flatten at 18 -18 r=7 s=20 frames=40 h=50
origin

# --- The rangers' station on its terrace above the east beach (5 m): Balboa's shack -------------------------------------
clear at 80 4 r=15
push at 80 4 h=5 yaw=90
# (its porch and steps to the east, toward the beach)
place Balboa_Shack stationhut at 0 0 yaw=-60
pop
# in front of the porch (its boards have no collider in Raft's model - things set on them fell through): the tool
# locker by its north end, the logbook on a crate under the window; the strongbox on the terrace north of the shack (its\n# floor has no collider either, and its room is full of Raft's own furniture)
place Locker toollocker at 90.4 8.2 ground yaw=90
place Crate_Big_01 logcrate at 90.7 5 ground yaw=5
place Note_Paper logbook at 90.7 5 h=7 sit drop yaw=80
place Placeable_Lantern_Metal - at 90.6 4.4 h=7 sit drop
place VG_Safe strongbox at 80.2 12 ground yaw=0
# by the station: the flag, the rangers' supplies, firewood, the station's zone
place Placeable_Flag_03 flagpost at 93 -6 ground
place Crate_Big_02 supplycrate at 74 -4.4 ground yaw=20
place "Box Small" rationbox at 76 -4.6 ground yaw=-10
place Firewood_1 woodpile at 73.5 11 ground yaw=80
place Zone_Trigger station at 91 3 h=6

# --- The Mama bear's den: Balboa's bear cave as a rock outcrop on the west plateau, its mouth to the east; the rangers'
# plank barricade across the mouth, grown over with vines; inside, the Mama bear (Raft's bear at size x2, as tall as
# Balboa's own Mama bear - CB8b) and Hendricks' pack -------------------------
push at -66 -9 yaw=90
clear from 0 6 to 0 -36 r=17
brush sand from 0 2 to 0 -34 r=7 s=10 frames=40
place BalboaCave_Bear dencave at 1.2 -18.4 y=5.2 scale=1.15
for vx -3.45 5.55 1.5
place Block_Wall_Wood vinewall at $vx -1 y=0
next
place "overgrowthIvy_long_01 Variant" vinewall at -2.4 -0.7 y=0
place "overgrowthIvy_long_02 Variant" vinewall at 1 -0.7 y=0
place "overgrowthIvy_long_01 Variant" vinewall at 4.3 -0.7 y=0
place Relay_Fence_pole - at -6 3 ground
place Note_Paper trailsign at -6 3 y=1.1 drop
place Zone_Trigger den at 1 -12 y=1.5
place Creature_Bear mamabear at 1 -22 y=0.5
place "Box Small" pack at -3 -27 ground yaw=30
place Note_Paper scrawl at 4.5 -7 ground yaw=200
pop

# --- The summit (50 m): the rangers' radio mast - two of the radio tower's thick pillars, its dish and lamp - and the
# radio desk under it ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
clear at 18 -18 r=8
push at 18 -18 h=50
place RT_PillarThick mastplate at 0 0 y=0
place RT_PillarThick - at 0 0 y=6
place RT_SatteliteDisc - at 0 0 y=12
place RT_RoofLamp - at 0 0 y=12.6
place "Table Office" radiodesk at 3 1.5 y=0 yaw=180
place RT_CommRadio mastradio at 3 1.5 y=2 sit drop yaw=180
place "Chair Office" - at 3 0.4 y=0 yaw=20
place "Box Small" sparesbox at -2.5 2 y=0 yaw=15
place Zone_Trigger summit at 0 0 y=1.5
pop

# --- Settings, story items, notes, behaviours, quest ------------------------------------------------------------------
# --- Things to gather, as suits the island (the user, 2026-10-05): mangoes, flowers, pineapples ----------
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_Tree_Mango" 6 at 0 0 r=77.0 seed=4165 free=5
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_Flower_Red" 4 at 0 0 r=77.0 seed=4175 free=3
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_Flower_Yellow" 4 at 0 0 r=77.0 seed=4176 free=3
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_PineappleLandmark" 6 at 0 0 r=77.0 seed=4185 free=3
# --- Raft's finds in the shallows round the island (lib_sea) ----------------------------------------
call shallows r=130 deep=5 n=3

info title=Balboa Remade
info author=Custom Islands
info description=Raft's Balboa made anew: a forest of pine and maple round a mountain, the rangers' station on its east terrace, the Mama bear's den in a rock outcrop on the west plateau and the rangers' radio mast on the summit. The rangers fled the bear - their strongbox still holds Balboa's blueprints. Raft Remade's third island.
island on.arrive=message||A forest of pine and maple climbs to a mountain - a radio mast on its summit. Below it on the east terrace, a ranger station, its door hanging open.

story machete|Ranger's machete|Machete|The rangers' old machete, from their tool locker: it cuts through vines.
story stationkey|Strongbox key|quest:Caravan_KeyInfirmary|The key to the rangers' strongbox, from Hendricks' pack.

note logbook Ranger's logbook | BALBOA RANGER STATION - LOGBOOK\n\nDay 41. The Mama bear came down to the terrace again. She took Hendricks' pack - the strongbox key was in it - and dragged it off to her den in the rocks on the west plateau.\nDay 43. Vines have grown over our old barricade at the den's mouth. The machete is in the tool locker.\nDay 44. We are leaving. Whoever reads this: the radio on the summit still works. Call out, and its desk will open for you.\n\n- Ranger Hayes
note flagpost Flag post | Nailed to the flag post: BALBOA RANGER STATION. Visitors report to the station. Beware of bears.
note mastplate Mast plate | Painted on the mast: BALBOA RANGER RADIO. Call on the desk set - the drawer opens when the line is live. Keep the lamp lit.
note trailsign Warning sign | BEAR DEN - KEEP OUT\nThe rangers' barricade. Do not cut the vines.
note scrawl Scrawled on a crate | She sleeps in the back. Hendricks' pack is in there with her - and the key with it.
note logcrate Crate under the window | The crate the logbook lay on: lamp oil, a spare coil of rope - and Hayes' pencil, worn to a stub.
loot logcrate Rope*1;Nail*4
prop logcrate loot.refill=0
note supplycrate Rangers' supply crate | The rangers' supply crate: planks for the barricade they never finished mending.
loot supplycrate Plank*5;Nail*6
prop supplycrate loot.refill=0
note rationbox Rangers' ration box | Hendricks' ration box: two tins gone, a note in his hand - "back by dark, bear or no bear".
loot rationbox Rope*1;Scrap*2
prop rationbox loot.refill=0
note woodpile Woodpile | Hendricks' firewood, split and stacked behind the shack against the winter - a few good planks among the logs.
loot woodpile Plank*3
prop woodpile loot.refill=0
note toollocker Tool locker | The rangers' tool locker: a machete in its sheath, rope, nails.
loot toollocker story:machete*1;Rope*2;Nail*8
prop toollocker loot.refill=0
note pack Hendricks' pack | Hendricks' pack, torn by claws: his flask, his notes - and the strongbox key.
loot pack story:stationkey*1;Rope*1;Scrap*3
prop pack loot.refill=0
note sparesbox Spare parts box | The rangers' spare parts for the mast: wire, a fuse, a cracked bulb for the lamp up top.
loot sparesbox Scrap*3;Nail*4
prop sparesbox loot.refill=0
note radiodesk Radio desk | The radio desk under the mast: a battery, the rangers' frequency list - and their last message, never sent.
loot radiodesk Battery*1;BioFuel*1;Plank*6
prop radiodesk loot.refill=0
prop radiodesk if.open=signal|ranger
prop radiodesk else.open=message||The desk's drawer is wired to the radio. Call out first.
note strongbox Ranger's strongbox | The rangers' strongbox: Balboa's blueprints and their fuel - and Hayes' last note: "Whoever opens this: the fuel pipes go to the engine room. Good luck."
loot strongbox Blueprint_Machete*1;Blueprint_BiofuelExtractor*1;Blueprint_Fueltank*1;Blueprint_Pipe_Fuel*1;BioFuel*2;Nail*10
prop strongbox loot.refill=0
prop strongbox if.open=take|story:stationkey|1
prop strongbox else.open=message||The strongbox is locked. Hayes wrote that the key went with Hendricks' pack.

prop vinewall obj.name=vinewall
prop vinewall beh.use=Cut through the vines
prop vinewall if.use=has|story:machete|1
prop vinewall on.use=message||The machete bites into the vines. They fall away - and the rotten planks behind them with them: the den's mouth is open.\nhide|vinewall
prop vinewall else.use=message||Thick vines over the rangers' plank barricade. You'd need a blade.
prop mastradio obj.name=mastradio
prop mastradio beh.use=Call out on the rangers' radio
prop mastradio on.use=message||The radio crackles to life. Far away, a voice answers: "Balboa? We hear you. Follow the traders' jingle south."\nsignal||ranger
# (Raft's comm radio as a ready piece only works with power (a running generator or Raft's battery charger part), which this island has none of: the rangers' radio worked for anyone and the radio desk - quest step 7 - stayed shut for good. The ready piece's lock taken off)
prop mastradio if.use=
prop mastradio else.use=

prop station zone.id=station
prop station zone.radius=8
prop station zone.message=The ranger station: its door hangs open, a logbook on a crate by the steps.
prop den zone.id=den
prop den zone.radius=8
prop den zone.message=The den: dark, the smell of bear - and something big stirring in the back.
prop summit zone.id=summit
prop summit zone.radius=7
prop summit zone.message=The summit: the rangers' radio mast, their desk and their radio.
prop mamabear creature.count=1
prop mamabear creature.size=2
prop mamabear creature.health=6
prop mamabear creature.damage=1.5
prop mamabear creature.respawn=0
prop mamabear creature.zone=den

quest title=The Rangers' Last Call
quest intro=A forest island with a ranger station on its east terrace. The rangers are gone; their logbook may say why.
step reach|station|1|Find the ranger station on the east terrace
step read|Flag post|1|Read the sign on the rangers' flag post by the beach path
step read|Ranger's logbook|1|Read the rangers' logbook on the crate by the steps
step open|Crate under the window|1|Open the crate the logbook lay on
step open|Rangers' supply crate|1|Search the rangers' supply crate south of the shack
step open|Tool locker|1|Open the tool locker at the porch's north end
step collect|story:machete|1|Take the rangers' machete - it cuts through vines
step open|Rangers' ration box|1|Check Hendricks' ration box beside the supply crate
step pages||7|Search the woodpile behind the shack: seven station pages for the journal
step read|Warning sign|1|Cross to the den on the west plateau and read the rangers' warning sign
step reach|den|1|Cut through the vines into the Mama bear's den
step read|Scrawled on a crate|1|Read what's scrawled on the crate inside the mouth
step kill|Bear|1|Face the Mama bear
step open|Hendricks' pack|1|Search Hendricks' pack in the back of the den
step collect|story:stationkey|1|Take the strongbox key from his pack
step reach|summit|1|Climb the mountain to the rangers' radio mast
step read|Mast plate|1|Read the plate painted on the radio mast
step open|Spare parts box|1|Search the rangers' spare parts box under the mast
step open|Radio desk|1|Call out on the summit's radio and open its desk
step open|Ranger's strongbox|1|Back at the station, open the rangers' strongbox with the key
step blueprint|Blueprint_Machete|1|Take the machete plans from the ranger's strongbox
step blueprint|Blueprint_BiofuelExtractor|1|Take the biofuel extractor plans from the ranger's strongbox
step blueprint|Blueprint_Fueltank|1|Take the fuel tank plans from the ranger's strongbox
step blueprint|Blueprint_Pipe_Fuel|1|Take the fuel pipe plans from the ranger's strongbox
quest done=The strongbox opens: the machete's blueprint, the biofuel refiner's, the fuel tank's and its pipe's. The voice on the radio said south - toward the traders.
quest reward=Plank*8;Rope*4;BioFuel*1

save Balboa Remade
